        <extendedTooltip>
          <name>TotalsExtendedTooltip</name>
          <id>317</id>
          <title>
            <key>en</key>
            <value>The reconciliation report is considered signed if:
- The reconciliation document is in the &quot;Reconciled without discrepancies&quot; or &quot;Reconciled with discrepancies&quot; status
- There are no AR/AP for the counterparty later than the period specified in the reconciliation document</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>fa</key>
            <value>صورت‌حساب تطبیق در صورتی امضاشده تلقی می‌شود که:
- سند تطبیق در وضعیت &quot;تطبیق‌شده بدون مغایرت&quot; یا &quot;تطبیق‌شده با مغایرت&quot; باشد
- دریافتنی/پرداختنی برای طرف حساب پس از دوره مشخص‌شده در سند تطبیق وجود نداشته باشد</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>ru</key>
            <value>Акт сверки считается подписанным, если:
- в документе сверки установлен статус &quot;Сверена без разногласий&quot; или &quot;Сверена с разногласиями&quot;
- по контрагенту нет расчетов позже периода, указанного в документе сверки</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>tr</key>
            <value>Mutabakat tutanağı imzalanmış sayılır, eğer:
- mutabakat belgesinde durumu &quot;Tutarsızlık olmadan mutabakat yapıldı&quot; veya &quot;Tutarsızlıklarla mutabakat yapıldı&quot; olarak belirlenmişse
- cari hesap için, mutabakat belgesinde belirtilen dönemden sonraki herhangi bir işlem yoksa</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>it</key>
            <value>The reconciliation report is considered signed if:
- The reconciliation document is in the &quot;Reconciled without discrepancies&quot; or &quot;Reconciled with discrepancies&quot; status
- There are no AR/AP for the counterparty later than the period specified in the reconciliation document</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>pl</key>
            <value>The reconciliation report is considered signed if:
- The reconciliation document is in the &quot;Reconciled without discrepancies&quot; or &quot;Reconciled with discrepancies&quot; status
- There are no AR/AP for the counterparty later than the period specified in the reconciliation document</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>vi</key>
            <value>The reconciliation report is considered signed if:
- The reconciliation document is in the &quot;Reconciled without discrepancies&quot; or &quot;Reconciled with discrepancies&quot; status
- There are no AR/AP for the counterparty later than the period specified in the reconciliation document</value>
          </title>
          <formatted>true</formatted>
